     -[0m[2m Every successful charge corresponds[0m[2m to one[0m[2m item[0m[2m (we[0m[2m only charge after[0m[2m res[0m[2merving,[0m[2m and we[0m[2m don't deliver[0m[2m without[0m[2m a[0m[2m successful charge)
     -[0m[2m No duplicate[0m[2m charges (id[0m[2mempotency in[0m[2m Payment[0m[2mGateway)
     
